      "author_handle": "hapydazy",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 1 month ago",
      "body": "I had an over abundance at the beginning because she was tiny and didn't latch on for a while so I expressed every time I filled up (that was often!!) and kept the breast milk frozen... I honestly can't remember now how I did it after she latched on.... I know that after a while the expressing machine stopped working and my boobs would only give up the milk for Aaralyn 🤔",
